  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "美食外送"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>作者：楊振裕</b></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">因為武漢肺炎疫情ê關係，大多數民眾ê生活型態kap經濟活動lóng受著真大ê衝擊。有一个真明顯ê趨勢，就是無形中，「美食外送」已經慢慢仔行入真濟小型家庭，受歡迎ê情形愈來愈普遍，tsiânn做一項熱門ê新行業。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我見擺去市區買mi̍h件iah是辦代誌，若是kan-na短短一tsat仔路，lóng是騎oo-tóo-bái khah濟，tiānn-tiānn ē去拄著五、六个「美食外送」ê送餐員，in mā是仝款騎oo-tóo-bái，大街小巷bùn來bùn去，tse差不多已經是目前現代人sù常ē-tàng看--著ê街景，無啥mi̍h thang感覺奇怪。我mā不時看著有外送員tī oo-tóo-bái頭前ê手huānn仔邊，裝一个leh khuè手機仔--ê，kā oo-tóo-bái停踮路邊，斟酌leh看街巷ê導覽圖，iah是khà電話參訂餐ê客戶聯絡。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">外送餐點ê khang-khuè看--起-來簡簡單單，m̄-koh tio̍h-ài忍受熱--人燒hut-hut ê日頭曝、寒--人冷sih-sih ê霜風khau，有tang時仔若是領mi̍h件延tshiân iah是路程耽誤，koh難免ē遭受顧客ê指責kap刁難，其中ê心酸、艱苦kap委屈，真正是無講無人知！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ē記得舊年ê熱--人，有一工早起10點半左右，我出門去市內揣朋友。Hit-tsūn日頭大大粒，bē輸ē咬--人--leh，無到一公里ê路途，我就熱kah kiōng-beh擋bē tiâu--ah。過陸橋了後是交通上複雜ê四叉路，頭前拄著紅燈，逐家lóng kā車停--落-來。仝hit時，mā有兩台美食外送ê oo-tóo-bái停--落-來，拄停tī我邊--a。我看hit兩个送餐員全身武裝打扮，戴安全帽仔koh掛喙am免講，其中一个穿長ńg ê外衫，另外一个掛手lông koh掛變色ê目鏡，車後ê保溫袋仔lóng té滿滿ê餐點。我想講：我一箍人kan-na穿一領短ńg ê siat-tsuh kap一條短褲tsat仔niâ，戴一頂安全帽仔，騎短短幾分鐘ê車就熱kah kiōng-beh叫m̄敢--ah，in án-ne規身軀封kah密tsiuh-tsiuh走tsông規工，thài有可能bē忝頭？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">90幾秒ê紅燈過了，青燈tú-tsiah to̍h--起-來niâ，hit兩个外送員『分秒必爭』，oo-tóo-bái油門催--落，馬上ǹg無仝ê方向衝--出-去--ah。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我看in ê khang-khuè m̄-nā辛苦，而且有潛在ê危險性！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">到朋友in兜以後，我kā見聞kap感受講hōo一對少年爸母聽，本底是beh參in交流意見，希望in時間上若ē-tàng，中晝頓盡量tī厝--裡家己tshuân，khah免hōo美食外送ê送餐員án-ne來回奔波。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">想bē到我開喙提起美食外送tsit四字niâ，hit對少年翁仔某隨就tuì喙應講：「阮知影，阮知影！你是leh講foodpanda iah是Uber Eats--mah ! In ê服務真好，lán lóng m̄免出門就送到位，確實有夠方便，而且菜色thìng好不時換新，感覺khah有變化，所以阮不時有leh叫！」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">聽著in án-ne回應，我喙去hōo that--起-來--ah，驚一下緊kā suà--落-去beh講ê話收倒tńg--來。有影to tio̍h！時代leh進步，lán頭殼若無tuè leh tńg-se̍h，參少年人ê距離kánn ē愈來愈遠--ooh！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「美食外送」是新興ê商業模式，看--起-來社會ê接受度koh不止仔kuân。老一勻ê人觀念ài變通，實在無必要用過頭khiû儉ê古板心態去看待。因為每一个行業lóng是時代ê產物，美食外送解決真濟因為工作iah是時間上無方便家己tshuân三頓ê人ê需求，莫怪tī競爭劇烈ê市場ē-tàng開拓新ê局面。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">希望tī產業良性發展ê考量之下，美食外送平台ê業者除了追求商業利純以外，mā ē-tàng充分照顧外送員ê權益kap福利，積極改善經營過程ê各種缺失，thang提供hōo消費者koh-khah滿意ê服務。</span></div><div style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEidmzvA9lOc9s4o-qZvhm-Ks_ER4SWOw9Z_QpLGIKC3g79J8pApQhpmMg6ydTU41hlWgeyk-PVYZdlGF1L17vhae_V5-oN0yZ8E5wBZuHaiMWDGa1GUHBRbkH8z1EsS3YkrNKV-FKdxyGBGYu8EDTBW7PVSiqMIkE8VRdznq845E4JMxhz7mGb5gIXvjQ=s1424\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEidmzvA9lOc9s4o-qZvhm-Ks_ER4SWOw9Z_QpLGIKC3g79J8pApQhpmMg6ydTU41hlWgeyk-PVYZdlGF1L17vhae_V5-oN0yZ8E5wBZuHaiMWDGa1GUHBRbkH8z1EsS3YkrNKV-FKdxyGBGYu8EDTBW7PVSiqMIkE8VRdznq845E4JMxhz7mGb5gIXvjQ=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhVTjGrtBSepIxlmJViUJ1pgM9JGHwX7o6_6Ad4khr-i88RYTtP6KMvlK6MBygieEXBqL756r6fDrIgODlr76_ItwhMkgOtKKEKQlvBxMixuDwVOY6iY49Uxw9XRG2yDP0J6tUyhieU9boOjEphc8_jMu-CZDxQ-r3J3PGcRYsV5Y9EVRjM42vtF-aPnw=s3036\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhVTjGrtBSepIxlmJViUJ1pgM9JGHwX7o6_6Ad4khr-i88RYTtP6KMvlK6MBygieEXBqL756r6fDrIgODlr76_ItwhMkgOtKKEKQlvBxMixuDwVOY6iY49Uxw9XRG2yDP0J6tUyhieU9boOjEphc8_jMu-CZDxQ-r3J3PGcRYsV5Y9EVRjM42vtF-aPnw=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgvLNrQBwmgcK_pspX1l-5yo1fkz1lPrVTWp0s0Iod4wjXh8PMyQytqJqyEO88p8MB-V0rB86FF-Zdk5nL7KjBHzE1LApxfnQS4WOAK8MENapnfuFi6iaoifs_jPYpqvRVAjzKoFECOeSHnY4BIa8h0cQTpBoMLOUqy2XUykpOa3krOPM7ybipM7V33wA=s3036\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgvLNrQBwmgcK_pspX1l-5yo1fkz1lPrVTWp0s0Iod4wjXh8PMyQytqJqyEO88p8MB-V0rB86FF-Zdk5nL7KjBHzE1LApxfnQS4WOAK8MENapnfuFi6iaoifs_jPYpqvRVAjzKoFECOeSHnY4BIa8h0cQTpBoMLOUqy2XUykpOa3krOPM7ybipM7V33wA=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br /></div></span></span></div><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></b></span></div><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></b></span></div><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">#</b><span><b>Lán來講看māi</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報334期，2022年1月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div>"
